{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手炎明熹與黃淑蔓（Feanna）齊齊殺入叱咤我最喜愛的女歌手最後五強，更是兩人首次入圍，兩人惺惺相惜。</p><p>近日炎明熹推出全新歌曲《在搖搖板上相對的我們》，她為宣傳新歌，邀請了「對手」黃淑蔓一齊合唱，並將片段放上社交網，片中兩人非常配合主題，分</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:25:46.482131+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T14:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T14:17:20.090151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T14:17:20.090151+00:00","content_hash":"e33bf32d7534f9fb2bb35323445df862fbc1b0a883eda2edfa2fa1644c652fb9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}